tags checks,draft`. This design contract defines that selection independently of heading wording and specifies the dispatched bundle variants it produces.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Selection Contract\n\n- **Each link supplies its selection.**\n  Comma-separated complete names select the target's presets above default, with unknown tags ignored.\n- **The guide specifies the command.**\n  One entry, optional tags, path resolution and shell quoting apply to direct and deferred compilation.\n\n### Bundle Identity\n\n- **Effective selections distinguish dispatched bundles.**\n  Scheduling, rewriting, cycle checks and validation share document, fragment and matched-preset identity.\n- **Variant names have one exact recipe.**\n  A canonical UTF-8 JSON preset set supplies the SHA-256 qualifier, with collision refusal.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Contract-to-confirmed-requirements and planned-fixture review | AC1 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md#t1-contract-and-fixture-review) |\n| T2 | Internal links, glossary, stale-rule scan, digest and diff checks | AC1 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md#t2-structural-checks) |\n| T3 | Existing immutable-pin conformance; candidate runtime support remains later work | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit/validation.md#t3-existing-pin-conformance) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [W00 delivery record](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/tree/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w00-the-design-states-explicit) — the immutable candidate pin, clause review and measured validation limits.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"20